RF Write-Back Mux

Key Files

1. Makefile (communication between Python and Icarus)
2. rf_wb_mux.sv (main SystemVerilog RTL)
3. python_stimulus_rf_wb_mux.py (deterministic stimulus)
4. python_random_stim_rf_wb_mux.py (random verification)
5. waveforms/rf_wb_mux.fst (simulation waveform)

Simulation Flow

Icarus <---- VPI ----> Python (Cocotb)

Function

d2r_sel_i = 00 -> ALU result
d2r_sel_i = 01 -> LAU result
d2r_sel_i = 10 -> PC + 4
d2r_sel_i = 11 -> 0
